### ============================================================
### E-Learning Multipaís — Courses Module
### CRUD de cursos y lecciones
### ============================================================

@baseUrl          = http://localhost:5277/api
@contentType      = application/json

@superAdminToken  = eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..8jKYLwwqR84CduJQZjY4cHyZ8pkqMQUiZ8Bo404b_gk
@adminToken       = eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..hSlxx69KTo1E1SWaAxrUMYStk9YH3dqeI6oi9pqSoTM
@instructorToken  = eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..uFJGamJfCgeM2BjLo0f-aLd7A0mtv-rtyu6aCi5I3xY
@studentToken     = eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..JNHWoLOI3S14TpL_54zauIHQQSt14PZm5J0nSTk-Gh8

@courseId         = f365429b-5400-43ed-9173-0a7ab4b467bb
@lessonId         = c1e25732-44be-4d1b-adbf-f4d860d0d610


# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 1. CATÁLOGO PÚBLICO
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 1a. Catálogo del país del usuario autenticado (200 OK)
GET {{baseUrl}}/courses
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

###

### 1b. Catálogo con búsqueda por título
GET {{baseUrl}}/courses?search=excel
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

###

### 1c. Catálogo paginado
GET {{baseUrl}}/courses?page=1&pageSize=5
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

###

### 1d. Error — sin token (401 Unauthorized)
GET {{baseUrl}}/courses

###

### 1e. Detalle de un curso (200 OK)
GET {{baseUrl}}/courses/{{courseId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

###

### 1f. Error — curso inexistente (404 Not Found)
GET {{baseUrl}}/courses/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

###


# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 2. ADMIN — LISTA COMPLETA
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 2a. Super Admin — todos los cursos
GET {{baseUrl}}/courses/admin
Authorization: Bearer {{superAdminToken}}

###

### 2b. Super Admin — filtrar por país
GET {{baseUrl}}/courses/admin?countryId=1
Authorization: Bearer {{superAdminToken}}

###

### 2c. Super Admin — solo inactivos
GET {{baseUrl}}/courses/admin?isActive=false
Authorization: Bearer {{superAdminToken}}

###

### 2d. Admin — solo ve cursos de su país (forzado automáticamente)
GET {{baseUrl}}/courses/admin
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

###

### 2e. Instructor — solo ve sus propios cursos (forzado automáticamente)
GET {{baseUrl}}/courses/admin
Authorization: Bearer {{instructorToken}}

###

### 2f. Error — Student intenta ver lista admin (403 Forbidden)
GET {{baseUrl}}/courses/admin
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

###


# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 3. CREAR CURSO
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 3a. Instructor crea curso en su país (201 Created)
### Guarda el id del response en @courseId
POST {{baseUrl}}/courses
Authorization: Bearer {{instructorToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "title": "Excel para Contadores",
  "description": "Aprende Excel desde cero hasta nivel avanzado",
  "thumbnailUrl": "http://localhost:5000/uploads/thumbnails/abc123_portada.jpg",
  "isGlobal": false
}

###

### 3b. Instructor crea curso global
POST {{baseUrl}}/courses
Authorization: Bearer {{instructorToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "title": "Introducción a la Programación",
  "description": "Conceptos básicos aplicables en cualquier país",
  "thumbnailUrl": null,
  "isGlobal": true
}

###

### 3c. Error — título vacío (400 Bad Request)
POST {{baseUrl}}/courses
Authorization: Bearer {{instructorToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "title": "",
  "description": "Descripción",
  "thumbnailUrl": null,
  "isGlobal": false
}

###

### 3d. Error — Student intenta crear curso (403 Forbidden)
POST {{baseUrl}}/courses
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "title": "Mi Curso",
  "isGlobal": false
}

###


# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 4. EDITAR CURSO
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 4a. Instructor edita su propio curso (204 No Content)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/courses/{{courseId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{instructorToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "title": "Excel para Contadores — Edición 2025",
  "description": "Descripción actualizada",
  "thumbnailUrl": null,
  "isGlobal": false
}

###

### 4b. Admin edita cualquier curso de su país (204 No Content)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/courses/{{courseId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "title": "Excel Avanzado",
  "description": "Actualizado por admin",
  "thumbnailUrl": null,
  "isGlobal": false
}

###

### 4c. Error — Instructor intenta editar curso de otro instructor (403 Forbidden)
### Usa el token de un instructor diferente al creador del curso

###


# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 5. PUBLICAR / DESPUBLICAR
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 5a. Error — publicar curso sin lecciones (409 Conflict)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/courses/{{courseId}}/toggle-status
Authorization: Bearer {{instructorToken}}

###

### 5b. Publicar curso con lecciones (204 No Content)
### Agrega lecciones primero con la sección 7, luego ejecuta este
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/courses/{{courseId}}/toggle-status
Authorization: Bearer {{instructorToken}}

###

### 5c. Despublicar curso (vuelve a ejecutar el mismo)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/courses/{{courseId}}/toggle-status
Authorization: Bearer {{instructorToken}}

###


# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 6. ASIGNAR PAÍSES
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 6a. Asignar múltiples países a un curso (204 No Content)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/courses/{{courseId}}/countries
Authorization: Bearer {{superAdminToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "countryIds": [1, 2]
}

###

### 6b. Reasignar — reemplaza la lista anterior
PUT {{baseUrl}}/courses/{{courseId}}/countries
Authorization: Bearer {{superAdminToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "countryIds": [1]
}

###

### 6c. Error — curso global no acepta asignación de países (409 Conflict)
### Usa el courseId de un curso global creado en 3b

###

### 6d. Error — país inexistente (404 Not Found)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/courses/{{courseId}}/countries
Authorization: Bearer {{superAdminToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "countryIds": [9999]
}

###


# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 7. LECCIONES — CREAR
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 7a. Crear lección de video (200 OK)
### Guarda el id del response en @lessonId
POST {{baseUrl}}/courses/{{courseId}}/lessons
Authorization: Bearer {{instructorToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "title": "Clase 1 — Introducción a Excel",
  "type": "video",
  "contentUrl": "http://localhost:5000/uploads/videos/abc123_clase1.mp4",
  "isRequired": true
}

###

### 7b. Crear lección de PDF
POST {{baseUrl}}/courses/{{courseId}}/lessons
Authorization: Bearer {{instructorToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "title": "Material de apoyo",
  "type": "pdf",
  "contentUrl": "http://localhost:5000/uploads/pdfs/abc123_material.pdf",
  "isRequired": false
}

###

### 7c. Crear lección de quiz (sin contentUrl)
POST {{baseUrl}}/courses/{{courseId}}/lessons
Authorization: Bearer {{instructorToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "title": "Quiz — Capítulo 1",
  "type": "quiz",
  "contentUrl": null,
  "isRequired": true
}

###

### 7d. Error — video sin contentUrl (400 Bad Request)
POST {{baseUrl}}/courses/{{courseId}}/lessons
Authorization: Bearer {{instructorToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "title": "Clase sin URL",
  "type": "video",
  "contentUrl": null,
  "isRequired": true
}

###

### 7e. Error — tipo inválido (400 Bad Request)
POST {{baseUrl}}/courses/{{courseId}}/lessons
Authorization: Bearer {{instructorToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "title": "Lección",
  "type": "audio",
  "contentUrl": null,
  "isRequired": true
}

###


# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 8. LECCIONES — EDITAR Y ELIMINAR
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 8a. Editar lección (204 No Content)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/courses/{{courseId}}/lessons/{{lessonId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{instructorToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "title": "Clase 1 — Introducción actualizada",
  "contentUrl": "http://localhost:5000/uploads/videos/nuevo_abc123.mp4",
  "isRequired": true
}

###

### 8b. Eliminar lección (204 No Content)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/courses/{{courseId}}/lessons/{{lessonId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{instructorToken}}

###


# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 9. REORDENAR LECCIONES
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 9a. Reordenar — envía la lista completa con el nuevo orden
### Reemplaza los GUIDs con los IDs reales de tus lecciones
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/courses/{{courseId}}/lessons/reorder
Authorization: Bearer {{instructorToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "orders": [
    { "lessonId": "01f3a755-6c49-4a4d-9fd1-03d481cbabe2", "newOrder": 3 },
    { "lessonId": "4d41ec6b-1b93-4fdc-a5a1-8e13e0ad282f", "newOrder": 1 },
    { "lessonId": "f15a3131-9551-44ba-85a0-6db452a05700", "newOrder": 2 }
  ]
}

###

### 9b. Error — orden duplicado (400 Bad Request)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/courses/{{courseId}}/lessons/reorder
Authorization: Bearer {{instructorToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "orders": [
    { "lessonId": "f15a3131-9551-44ba-85a0-6db452a05700", "newOrder": 1 },
    { "lessonId": "4d41ec6b-1b93-4fdc-a5a1-8e13e0ad282f", "newOrder": 1 }
  ]
}

###


# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 10. ELIMINAR CURSO
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 10a. Eliminar curso inactivo (204 No Content)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/courses/{{courseId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{instructorToken}}

###

### 10b. Error — eliminar curso publicado con inscritos (409 Conflict)
### Publica el curso (5b), inscribe un estudiante y luego intenta eliminar
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/courses/{{courseId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{instructorToken}}

###
